705
00:24:34,833 --> 00:24:35,633
We love you.

706
00:24:35,633 --> 00:24:36,600
- Thank you.

707
00:24:36,600 --> 00:24:37,600
Thank you.

708
00:24:37,600 --> 00:24:38,600
We love you.

709
00:24:38,600 --> 00:24:39,600
