and Merlin were buddies.

2334
01:22:36,467 --> 01:22:38,767
- It's a mad, mad,
mad, mad, mad,

2335
01:22:38,767 --> 01:22:40,767
mad, mad, mad, mad, mad, mad,

2336
01:22:40,767 --> 01:22:44,900
mad, mad, mad, mad,
mad, mad, mad world.

2337
01:22:44,900 --> 01:22:48,200
- So he's gonna try
and breed the dog?

2338
01:22:48,200 --> 01:22:49,700
- Don't make me laugh, Santa.

2339
01:22:49,700 --> 01:22:51,100
- Shoo.

2340
01:22:51,100 --> 01:22:53,633
